      'Some of the smallest self-employed people (OSVČ) in the flat-rate tax regime can opt out of sales registration in the so-called EET OFF regime. The Financial Administration describes the conditions on <a href="https://eet.gov.cz/cs/eet-off/co-je-rezim-eet-off" rel="noopener">eet.gov.cz</a>.',
